    "# Titanic - Machine Learning from Disaster\n",
    "\n",
    "A kaggle prediction competition, view [here](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/titanic/data?select=gender_submission.csv)\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Libraries and Functions\n",
    "2. Import Data\n",
    "3. Analyse Data\n",
    "4. Preprocessing\n",
    "5. Train Data\n",
    "6. Test Data\n",
    "7. Export"
   ]
  },
