   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "284b3f8d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Analysing Features\n",
    "\n",
    "Some features can be expanded as it raise some possible correlation\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Does having any `SibSp` matter in survival?\n",
    "2. Is `Age` relevant to survival? \n",
